  "body_html": "<h1>Rationalizable Strategy</h1>\n<p>In a compact continuous game, define\n$$\n  S_i(1)=BR_i(S_{-i})\n$$\nand inductively\n$$\n  S_i(k+1)=BR_i(S_{-i}(k)).\n$$\nThe rationalizable strategy set of player $i$ is\n$$\n  S_i^\\infty=\\bigcap_{k\\ge 1}S_i(k).\n$$\nA profile $s$ is rationalizable if $s_i\\in S_i^\\infty$ for every player $i$.</p>",
